# *
# * \par FILE        :  S_NWC_PRODIO_L1SD.cf
# *
# * \par TYPE        :  (PRIVATE) Product Configuration File for L1SD
# *
# * \par FUNCTION    :
# *                     Defines Product information to be used by PRODIO
# *                     to generate L1SD product in netCDF format
